L15:  *
L16:  * Existing data is never moved (only appended). remove neutralizes this addon
L17:  * (its main module becomes an empty stub) and strips its renderer script tag /
L18:  * preload lines, without touching other addons. restore-all copies the shared
L19:  * pristine backup back over app.asar. Run while OpenCode is closed.
L20:  *
L21:  *   node apply.js install|remove|restore-all|status|verify [--app <dir>] [--force]
